description: >
  QA log tracking four issues in the ancestor chain enhancement — scan summary regression, status badge suppression, missing edge-case test, and stale aide_validate tool description.
intent: >
  Verify the discover tool enhancement — ancestor chain, description field, and
  status field — against src/tools/discover/.aide. Four issues found; three are
  blocking.
